Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.86,0:00:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,《Good Luck, Baby!》\NChappell Roan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.64,0:00:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine, it's cool \N♪ 没关系，挺好的 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.14,0:00:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You can say that we are nothing\N♪ 你可以说我们毫无关系 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.69,0:00:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know the truth\N♪ 但你知道真相 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.49,0:00:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And guess I'm the fool\N♪ 我想我就是那个傻瓜 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,With her arms out like an angel through the car sunroof\N♪ 她像天使一样把手臂伸出汽车天窗 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.05,0:00:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna call it off\N♪ 我不想就此结束 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.64,0:00:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But you don't wanna call it love\N♪ 但你不想称之为爱 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.73,0:00:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You only wanna be the one that I call baby\N♪ 你只想成为我叫宝贝的那个人 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.58,0:00:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You can kiss a hundred boys in bars\N♪ 你可以在酒吧里亲吻一百个男孩 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.83,0:00:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot another shot, try to stop the feeling\N♪ 再干一杯，试图停止这种感觉 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.13,0:00:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You can say it's just the way you are\N♪ 你可以说这就是你的本性 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.91,0:00:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Make a new excuse, another stupid reason\N♪ 找个新借口，再编个愚蠢的理由 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.86,0:01:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, babe! Well good luck, babe!\N♪ 祝你好运，宝贝！好吧，祝你好运，宝贝！ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.77,0:01:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd have to stop the world just to stop the feeling\N♪ 你得让世界停止才能停止这种感觉 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.53,0:01:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, babe!\N♪ 祝你好运，宝贝！ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.56,0:01:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well good luck, Well good luck, babe!\N♪ 好吧，祝你好运，好吧，祝你好运，宝贝！ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.91,0:01:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd have to stop the world just to stop the feeling\N♪ 你得让世界停止才能停止这种感觉 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.19,0:01:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm cliche, Who cares?\N♪ 我很老套，谁在乎呢？ ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.19,0:01:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a sexually explicit kind of love affair\N♪ 这是一种露骨的爱情 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.77,0:01:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And I cry it's not fair\N♪ 我哭着说这不公平 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.12,0:01:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need a little lovin', I just need a little air\N♪ 我只需要一点爱，我只需要一点空间 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.57,0:01:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Think I'm gonna call it off\N♪ 我想我要结束它了 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.37,0:01:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you call it love\N♪ 即使你称之为爱 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.52,0:01:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanna love someone who calls me baby\N♪ 我只想爱一个叫我宝贝的人 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.24,0:01:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You can kiss a hundred boys in bars\N♪ 你可以在酒吧里亲吻一百个男孩 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.97,0:01:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot another shot try to stop the feeling\N♪ 再干一杯，试图停止这种感觉 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.89,0:01:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You can say it's just the way you are\N♪ 你可以说这就是你的本性 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.17,0:01:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Make a new excuse another stupid reason\N♪ 找个新借口，再编个愚蠢的理由 ♪
