Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.59,0:02:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And when you wake up next to him\N♪ 当你在他身边醒来 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.07,0:02:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,In the middle of the night\N♪ 在午夜时分 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.82,0:02:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,With your head in your hands\N♪ 双手抱头 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.59,0:02:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing more than his wife\N♪ 你不过是他的妻子 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.88,0:02:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And when you think about me, all of those years ago\N♪ 当你想起我，想起那些年前 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.73,0:02:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're standing face to face with "I told you so"\N♪ 你正面对着 "我早告诉过你" ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.49,0:02:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to say, I told you so\N♪ 我讨厌说，我早告诉过你 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.81,0:02:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You know I hate to say it but\N♪ 你知道我讨厌说，但 ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.06,0:02:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you so\N♪ 我早告诉过你 ♪
